{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lonelight is an action adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic Earth-3.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a quick look at what the DEMO has to offer:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742950/extras/gif5.gif?t=1755191517\" /></span><strong>Explore the first area: Southern Lab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the DEMO, you play through the entire first area of Lonelight, here's what you can expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm introduction to the game's mechanics and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging obstacles along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction to the game's combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boss fight to test your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742950/extras/gif4.gif?t=1755191517\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introducing the Guidelines!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The DEMO also introduces you to the Guidelines, a place featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming yet unsettling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very distinct soundtrack from the rest of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal settings exploring wild themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of questions left to answer...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Don't let the light fade away.&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742950